">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;padding:20px 22px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.35\"><b style=\"color:#b86a0a\">C</b> is always the white key just left of the <b>two</b> black keys.</div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;padding:20px 22px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.35\">White keys repeat <b>C D E F G A B</b>. After B comes C again.</div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1;padding:20px 22px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.35\">Each black key has two names: <b>\u266f sharp</b> (up) or <b>\u266d flat</b> (down).</div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com piano basics</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "piano-half-steps-whole-steps": [880, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:880px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Sharps, flats and steps</div><h1>Half steps and whole steps</h1><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:16px 30px 6px\"><svg width=\"1080\" height=\"520\" viewBox=\"0 0 1080 520\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 1